  "remainingBoundaries": [
    "MeleeAttack/RangedAttack and both Multi subclasses inherit timing calculation, but inheritance is not proof of every lifecycle branch. Multi classes override CheckAnotherSpell, OnCastEnd, OnWaitForPreDelay and OnWaitForTriggerDelta; existing fixed-multi rejection rules remain.",
    "RangedAttack overrides OnWaitForPostDelay and OnCastEnd. Existing waitForProjectileInvalid and projectile completion callbacks must remain authoritative; scaled animation duration alone must not end those casts.",
    "No new decoding of unreadable Multi method bodies, main enemy AI scheduler, attack cooldown reset policy, target ordering, or dynamic midcast attack-speed event ordering was performed.",
    "The cached ordinary action end animation Move is a configuration observation. The numerical leftover movement window under the project attack-cooldown clock is an implementation inference, not a newly recovered complete native movement state machine.",
    "No Scale-named battle subclass/method was found in this cached metadata; the observed no-upper-cap branch is maxAnimScale<0. Custom subclasses and XLua hotfix overrides are not certified by this evidence.",
    "No game code, source snapshot, generated battle data, or package was changed by this evidence task."
  ],
  "priorRegressionBoundary": {
    "docs": [
      "docs/mechanics/enemy-basic-actions.md:45",
      "docs/mechanics/enemy-skills.md:47"
    ],
    "test": "tools/_flying_block_smoke.js",
    "observation": "The old flying regression validated no blocker displacement, then called finishEnemyAttack and set cd=999 before asserting movement. It did not verify movement between naturally timed attacks."
  }
